ntigen cross presentation in dendritic cells", "journal": "Curr Opin Immunol", "pages": "109-17", "pubMedIdentifier": 20171863, "volume": 22, "year": 2010, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20171863", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 1236477, "displayName": "The nature of the phagosomal membrane: endoplasmic reticulum versus plasmalemma", "title": "The nature of the phagosomal membrane: endoplasmic reticulum versus plasmalemma", "journal": "J Leukoc Biol", "pages": "878-85", "pubMedIdentifier": 15728715, "volume": 77, "year": 2005, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15728715", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "species": [{"dbId": 48887, "displayName": "Homo sapiens", "name": ["Homo sapiens", "H. sapiens", "Hs", "human", "man"], "taxId": "9606", "crossReference": [{"dbId": 72938, "displayName": "NCBI_taxonomy:9606", "databaseName": "NCBI Taxonomy", "identifier": "9606", "url": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Taxonomy/Browser/wwwtax.cgi?mode=Info&id=9606", "className": "DatabaseIdentifier", "schemaClass": "DatabaseIdentifier"}], "abbreviation": "HSA", "className": "Species", "schemaClass": "Species"}], "doi": "10.3180/R-HSA-1236974.2", "hasDiagram": false, "hasEHLD": false, "lastUpdatedDate": "2017-04-20", "hasEvent": [8863895], "schemaClass": "Pathway", "className": "Pathway"}], "followingEvent": [{"dbId": 8863973, "displayName": "Fusion of ERC and phagosome", "stId": "R-HSA-8863973", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-8863973.3", "isInDisease": false, "isInferred": false, "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["Fusion of ERC and phagosome"], "releaseDate": "2016-06-15", "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "precedingEvent": [8863895], "literatureReference": [{"dbId": 8863919, "displayName": "TLR signals induce phagosomal MHC-I delivery from the endosomal recycling compartment to allow cross-presentation", "title": "TLR signals induce phagosomal MHC-I delivery from the endosomal recycling compartment to allow cross-presentation", "journal": "Cell", "pages": "506-21", "pubMedIdentifier": 25083866, "volume": 158, "year": 2014, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25083866", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "species": [48887], "isChimeric": false, "category": "omitted", "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "BlackBoxEvent"}], "literatureReference": [8863919, {"dbId": 8863956, "displayName": "Phosphorylation of SNAP-23 by IkappaB kinase 2 regulates mast cell degranulation", "title": "Phosphorylation of SNAP-23 by IkappaB kinase 2 regulates mast cell degranulation", "journal": "Cell", "pages": "485-95", "pubMedIdentifier": 18692471, "volume": 134, "year": 2008, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18692471", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 8863879, "displayName": "I\u03baB kinase phosphorylation of SNAP-23 controls platelet secretion", "title": "I\u03baB kinase phosphorylation of SNAP-23 controls platelet secretion", "journal": "Blood", "pages": "4567-74", "pubMedIdentifier": 23613522, "volume": 121, "year": 2013, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23613522", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "reviewed": [{"dbId": 8871418, "displayName": "Bergeron, JJ, 2016-05-16", "dateTime": "2016-05-16 19:29:55", "className": "InstanceEdit", "schemaClass": "InstanceEdit"}], "species": [48887], "summation": [{"dbId": 8863920, "displayName": "A major reserve of MHC-I in dendritic cells reside within th...", "text": "A major reserve of MHC-I in dendritic cells reside within the endocytic recycling compartments (ERC). MHC-I trafficking to the ERC is regulated by the activity of Rab11a and subsequent trafficking from ERC to phagosomes is controlled by TLR-MyD88-IKK2-dependent phosphorylation of phagosomal SNAP23. Toll-like receptor (TLR) signalling regulate cross-presentation as they regulate phagocytosis and phagolysosomal fusion (Nair et al. 2011). MHC-I bearing ERC are enriched with R-SNAREs like RAB11a, VAMP3, and VAMP8. These SNARE molecules can interact with Q-SNARE SNAP23 present on phagosomes and this mediates membrane fusion. This interaction of SNAP23 with R-SNAREs require phosphorylation of SNAP23 (on Ser-95) by IKK2, and IKK2 is activated by TLR signalling. SNAP23 phosphorylation may increase SNAP23 binding to SNAREs. It may also regulate platelet and mast cell secretion (Karim et al. 2013, Suziki & Verma 2008).", "literatureReference": [{"dbId": 8863881, "displayName": "An updated view of the intracellular mechanisms regulating cross-presentation", "title": "An updated view of the intracellular mechanisms regulating cross-presentation", "journal": "Front Immunol", "pages": "401", "pubMedIdentifier": 24319447, "volume": 4, "year": 2013, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24319447", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, {"dbId": 8863930, "displayName": "Co-ordination of incoming and outgoing traffic in antigen-presenting cells by pattern recognition receptors and T cells", "title": "Co-ordination of incoming and outgoing traffic in antigen-presenting cells by pattern recognition receptors and T cells", "journal": "Traffic", "pages": "1669-76", "pubMedIdentifier": 21762455, "volume": 12, "year": 2011, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21762455", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "transition", "catalystActivity": [{"dbId": 8863859, "displayName": "protein serine/threonine kinase activity of CHUK:IKBKB:IKBKG [cytosol]", "catalyzedEvent": [8863895], "physicalEntity": {"dbId": 168113, "displayName": "CHUK:IKBKB:IKBKG [cytosol]", "stId": "R-HSA-168113", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-168113.3", "maxDepth": 2, "name": ["CHUK:IKBKB:IKBKG", "IKKA:IKBKB:IKBKG", "IKK complex", "Inhibitor of KappaB kinase (IKK) Complex"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "catalystActivities": [8863859], "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "Complex", "className": "Complex"}, "className": "CatalystActivity", "schemaClass": "CatalystActivity"}], "catalystActivityReference": {"dbId": 9643525, "displayName": "protein serine/threonine kinase activity of CHUK:IKBKB:IKBKG [cytosol] I\u03baB kinase phosphorylation of SNAP-23 controls platelet secretion", "literatureReference": [8863956, 8863879], "className": "CatalystActivityReference", "schemaClass": "CatalystActivityReference"}, "input": [{"dbId": 8863966, "displayName": "SNAP23 [phagocytic vesicle membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-8863966", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-8863966.2", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["SNAP23", "Synaptosomal-associated protein 23", "SNP23_HUMAN"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "consumedByEvent": [8863895], "species": 48887, "endCoordinate": 211, "referenceType": "ReferenceGeneProduct", "startCoordinate": 1, "className": "Protein", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "EntityWithAccessionedSequence"}, {"dbId": 113592, "displayName": "ATP [cytosol]", "stId": "R-ALL-113592", "stIdVersion": "R-ALL-113592.5", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["ATP", "Adenosine 5'-triphosphate", "ATP(4-)"], "crossReference": [{"dbId": 29359, "displayName": "COMPOUND:C00002", "databaseName": "COMPOUND", "identifier": "C00002", "url": "https://www.kegg.jp/entry/C00002", "className": "DatabaseIdentifier", "schemaClass": "DatabaseIdentifier"}], "isRequired": [{"dbId": 72781, "displayName": "Requirement by 'ATP [cytosol]'", "stId": "R-HSA-72781", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-72781.1", "regulator": 113592, "schemaClass": "Requirement", "className": "Requirement"}], "negativelyRegulates": [{"dbId": 453366, "displayName": "Negative regulation by 'ATP [cytosol]'", "stId": "R-HSA-453366", "stIdVersion": "R-HS